&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you’ll love working at Faire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off, plus company-wide recharge days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave up to 16 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health coverage, with options varying by location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fertility and family-building benefits through Carrot, including a lifetime reimbursement allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support and coaching through Modern Health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stipends to support your professional development, wellness, and work from home needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-sponsored retirement plan, dependent on country of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
