&lt;li&gt;Review app work across teams to ensure a cohesive experience that meets our app goals, and monitor the app&#39;s metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vision for our core buying-journey components, including product tile, brand tile, product grid, filters, and global navigation, and set how they work across surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the metrics that quantify the impact of experience improvements, and build a shared view of impact across contributing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design, engineering, and PM leaders across Discovery and other pillars to make shared components scale across surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert for the components you own, partnering with teams that build on them to reach better solutions more efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the app and experience strategy to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
