&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of product management experience, including ownership of complex, scaled user-facing experiences, ideally at a marketplace or e-commerce company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong design and UX craft and taste, with a point of view on what great looks like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading work across multiple teams you did not manage, and bringing them toward one vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in your product area and a reputation as a collaborative partner that other teams seek out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills: you define success metrics and quantify the impact of experience changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform thinking: you think beyond the use case in front of you to how a solution scales across other experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design systems, mobile apps, or discovery experiences (search, browse, filters) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with AI tools and thinking about how they change the way product teams work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
